# Guided body session A (2026-11-27 draft). See wiki/device-test-batch.md.
#
#   node scripts/body_probe.mjs --out <dir> --steps scripts/sessions/session-a.steps
#   node scripts/probe_report.mjs <dir>
#
# The body asks on its own screen; the owner answers with one tap (left / middle / right third,
# or "tap toward" for directions). DSH's voice service must be off while this runs.
# ${ROOT} is the repository root. "label" lines mark sections for the report. Nothing here writes flash, NVS or settings;
# the volume changes apply to this session (the device's Save button is not touched).

# --- 0 baseline: what the body reports at rest (automatic) ---
label section:baseline
status
record imu,headTouch,ambient,power,battery 200 5000
mic 3000

# --- 1 audio self-check: speaker -> own microphone and echo reference (automatic, ~40 s) ---
label section:audio-volume
volume 30
duplex 1000 600 50 800
volume 50
duplex 1000 600 50 800
volume 70
duplex 1000 600 50 800
volume 90
duplex 1000 600 50 800
volume 100
duplex 1000 600 50 800
ask 刚才五声由轻到响。从哪一声开始刺耳或破音？_左=都还好_中=最后一两声_右=中间就开始 20
label section:audio-frequency
volume 70
duplex 250 400 50 600
duplex 500 400 50 600
duplex 2000 400 50 600
duplex 4000 400 50 600
duplex 8000 400 50 600
label section:audio-tail
duplex 1000 200 50 1500
duplex 1000 200 50 1500
duplex 1000 200 50 1500
ask 最后三声短音，每声结尾有没有多出一小段回音？_左=没有_右=有 15
label section:audio-current
volume 100
bgrecord power 100 5000
pause 500
duplex 1000 2500 90 500
bgwait
volume 60

# --- 2 the body listens: the Mac speaks known sentences (automatic, keep the room quiet) ---
label section:listen
ask 接下来_Mac_会读几句话给机器人听，请保持安静。准备好点一下屏幕 30
listen Sion，你好 3000
listen 今天下午三点提醒我给妈妈打电话 5000
listen 把灯调成蓝色，然后向左转头 5000
listen 我刚才说的数字是：七、二、九、四、零 5000
mic 3000

# --- 3 light ring geometry: one LED at a time, tap toward it (owner, ~1.5 min) ---
label section:leds
leds 0 #ffffff 10000
ask 朝亮着的那颗灯的方向，点屏幕的边缘 10
leds 1 #ffffff 10000
ask 朝亮着的那颗灯的方向，点屏幕的边缘 10
leds 2 #ffffff 10000
ask 朝亮着的那颗灯的方向，点屏幕的边缘 10
leds 3 #ffffff 10000
ask 朝亮着的那颗灯的方向，点屏幕的边缘 10
leds 4 #ffffff 10000
ask 朝亮着的那颗灯的方向，点屏幕的边缘 10
leds 5 #ffffff 10000
ask 朝亮着的那颗灯的方向，点屏幕的边缘 10
leds 6 #ffffff 10000
ask 朝亮着的那颗灯的方向，点屏幕的边缘 10
leds 7 #ffffff 10000
ask 朝亮着的那颗灯的方向，点屏幕的边缘 10
leds 8 #ffffff 10000
ask 朝亮着的那颗灯的方向，点屏幕的边缘 10
leds 9 #ffffff 10000
ask 朝亮着的那颗灯的方向，点屏幕的边缘 10
leds 10 #ffffff 10000
ask 朝亮着的那颗灯的方向，点屏幕的边缘 10
leds 11 #ffffff 10000
ask 朝亮着的那颗灯的方向，点屏幕的边缘 10
leds 0 #000000 20

# --- 4 ambient light / proximity: where the sensor is and its range (owner) ---
label section:ambient
ask 用手掌盖住屏幕上方，盖好后用另一只手点屏幕 20
record ambient 750 4000
ask 把手拿开，然后点屏幕 15
record ambient 750 4000

# --- 5 infrared: receive from a remote, then send (owner, phone camera for the send) ---
label section:ir-receive
ask 拿遥控器对准机器人。点屏幕后，在_8_秒内连按几下遥控器任意键 20
record infrared 100 8000
label section:ir-send
ask 打开手机相机对准机器人正面。点屏幕后看取景框里有没有紫白色的闪光 30
ir 0 69
pause 400
ir 0 69
pause 400
ir 0 69
ask 手机里看到闪光了吗？_左=看到_右=没看到 15

# --- 6 NFC (v78 retry): card on 5 reads, card off 2 reads (owner) ---
label section:nfc-on
ask 把卡放到_NFC_的位置，放好后点屏幕 30
record nfc 100 3000
nfc ndef
nfc ndef
nfc ndef
nfc ndef
nfc ndef
label section:nfc-off
ask 把卡拿开，然后点屏幕 20
nfc ndef
nfc ndef
record nfc 100 2000

# --- 7 camera: first real photos; also data for head tracking (owner) ---
label section:camera
ask 请站在机器人正前方、脸对着它。点屏幕后_2_秒拍照 30
pause 2000
photo
ask 请往你的左边走一步，脸仍对着它。点屏幕后_2_秒拍照 30
pause 2000
photo
ask 请往你的右边走两步，脸仍对着它。点屏幕后_2_秒拍照 30
pause 2000
photo

# --- 8 head motion: free swing, then a gentle hold (stall rule), with current (owner) ---
label section:motion-free
move 0 350 800
bgrecord power,imu 100 6000
pause 500
move 500 350 1200
move -500 350 1500
move 0 350 1200
bgwait
label section:motion-stall
ask 准备用手轻轻扶住头，不让它转。点屏幕，1_秒后它会试着向右转 30
pause 1000
bgrecord power 100 6000
move 600 350 1500
read
pause 2000
read
bgwait
ask 松开手。刚才它是很快放弃用力，还是一直在顶？_左=很快放弃_右=一直在顶 20
move 0 350 1000

# --- 9 fish tank: character-only crops at 30 / 45 / 60 fps (owner watches) ---
label section:fishtank-store
storecrops ${ROOT}/work/active/v75-frames/render/turn-crops 0
label section:fishtank-30
ask 接下来看鱼缸里的她转身，看完回答顺不顺。点屏幕开始 30
timeline ${ROOT}/work/active/v75-frames/render/turn-crops-30fps.json
ask 顺吗？_左=顺_中=有点卡_右=很卡 15
label section:fishtank-45
timeline ${ROOT}/work/active/v75-frames/render/turn-crops-45fps.json
ask 这次呢？_左=顺_中=有点卡_右=很卡 15
label section:fishtank-60
timeline ${ROOT}/work/active/v75-frames/render/turn-crops-60fps.json
ask 这次呢？_左=顺_中=有点卡_右=很卡 15
drop all

# --- end ---
label section:end
clear
status
